				"4B4A1C9CC8E643DD"
			]
			description: [
				"A Spark Plug screws into a Furnace's or Steel Furnace's side or back. It sparks only from about 900 V, so step up with a transformer. While it sparks it lights any fuel there to catch, and a switch or relay in its circuit decides when. No more running round with flint and steel."
			]
			id: "53D6AD1F23844450"
			optional: true
			rewards: [ ]
