			description: [
				"Power Grid's heating coil and basin heater count by their real temperature: 200 °C is &eWarm&r, 400 &6Hot&r, 600 &cSearing&r and 1,200 &bBlazing&r. Under a Furnace they heat it with no fuel at all."
				""
				"Skip the Bellows: moving air only cools an electric heater."
